codex
The offending writer was entirely unused: constructing `SummaryWriter("./logs")` only launched tensorboardX’s `EventFileWriter` background thread; no scalar or event was ever submitted through it. I’ve removed that import and construction from classification H-SFP, leaving `EHSFPMetricsLogger.append_jsonl()` and every metric assembly call untouched. Next I’m running the available unit suite plus focused static checks.
